{"transcript":"ˈsɪkənɪŋli","exists":true,"definitions":["In a way that causes nausea or disgust.","To an excessive or unpleasant degree."],"examples":["The smell was sickeningly sweet.","He was sickeningly optimistic.","The food was sickeningly rich."],"lemma":"sickening","lemmaPos":"adjective","synonyms":["nauseatingly","disgustingly","repulsively","excessively"],"number":"singular","source":"sickeningly"}